      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ohh～, such wonderful support! \r\nYour encouragement has sparked the image in me! \r\nThe image keeps coming to me, little by little～\r\nWith this, the Christmas song is finally complete!",
        "Jp" : "おお～、素晴らしい応援！\r\nあなたの応援で、私にイメージがッ！\r\nどんどんイメージが湧いてきます～\r\nこれでクリスマスソングも無事に完成ッ！"
