      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "In gratitude for your wonderful posing, \r\nallow me to present you with this—! \r\nIt is a mysterious stone that an overseas \r\ntraveler left behind as payment for my song.",
        "Jp" : "あなたの素晴らしいポージングに感謝して\r\nお礼にこちらを差し上げましょう――！\r\n先日、異国の旅人が私の歌のお代にと\r\n置いていった不思議な石でございます"
