      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ah, before that, let me show proper gratitude. \r\n—Among the stones I acquired recently, \r\nthere was a rock I didn't recognize.",
        "Jp" : "ああ、その前にきちんと礼をしておこう\r\n――先日仕入れた石材の中に\r\n見覚えの無い石ころが紛れ込んでいてな"
