      "GmdIndex" : 32,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "It's too small to be made into a weapon. \r\nYet, it's also too difficult to use as decoration. \r\nThere's no point in me keeping it, so \r\nI've been looking for someone to take it.",
        "Jp" : "武器にするには小さすぎる\r\nかといって装飾に使うにも加工が難しい\r\n俺が持っていても仕方がないから\r\n貰い手を探していたところだ"
