      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 35,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ah, it's you. \r\nYou've come at just the right time. \r\nSorry to ask so suddenly, but are you \r\nknowledgeable about wine?",
        "Jp" : "ああ、お前か\r\n丁度いいところに来てくれたな\r\n急な話で悪いんだが、お前――酒には詳しいか？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 699960,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 36,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "At the temple's Christmas party, \r\neveryone is preparing in their own way, \r\nbut I've been made responsible \r\nfor acquiring the wine.",
        "Jp" : "神殿のクリスマスパーティとやらで\r\n皆がそれぞれ準備をしているんだが\r\n――俺は酒の調達担当にされた"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 699961,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 37,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Though, as you can see, I don't drink. \r\nI did, however, hear from Alan, a fan of liquor, \r\nthat there's a popular drink \r\ngoing around these days.",
        "Jp" : "ただ――こう見えて酒は飲まない主義でな\r\nまぁ、酒好きのアランに話を聞いて\r\n近頃流行りの酒があるってことまではわかった"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 699962,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 38,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "But the real issue comes after that. \r\nThe quantity of alcohol needed for the party \r\nis more than I can gather alone. \r\nIt's simply too much for one person.",
        "Jp" : "だが、そこから先が問題だ\r\nなんせ、パーティに来る人数分の酒だ――\r\n一人ではなかなか集められん"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 699963,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 39,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "So, I wanted to ask if you could help me gather \r\nsome of it. It's a simple request, really. \r\nI'm sure it's not unfamiliar to you.",
        "Jp" : "そこでお前に、調達を少し\r\n手伝ってもらいたいって話だ\r\n――よくある話だろ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 712943,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
