      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 43,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I wonder what a shooting star is really like. \r\nAh, but if they were real, would we, who work to \r\nbring happiness to people, be put out of work?",
        "Jp" : "流れ星ってどんな物なんでしょう\r\nあっ、でも、もしそれが本当にあったとしたら\r\n人々に幸せを届けるべく活動してるあたしたちも\r\nお払い箱になるんですかねー？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 700553,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
