      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 44,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Phew, with this, the alcohol is ready. \r\nYour speed at work is nothing new, but still, \r\nimpressive as always.",
        "Jp" : "ふう、これで酒が揃ったな\r\n――お前の仕事の速さはいつものことだが、流石だ"
