      "GmdIndex" : 45,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Perhaps I should use this opportunity\r\nto learn about alcohol. \r\nWell... even if I gather the knowledge, \r\nI still wouldn't be able to drink much.",
        "Jp" : "これを機に酒について勉強でもするか\r\nまぁ――知識を集めたところで\r\nそう飲めはしないんだが――"
