      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ho ho ho, how are the Christmas preparations \r\ncoming along? It's truly a wonderful thing, \r\npreparing with everyone's help and having fun. \r\nIsn't it just splendid?",
