      "GmdIndex" : 48,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "So, how was the party? \r\nThanks to you, everyone \r\nwas happy and enjoyed themselves.",
        "Jp" : "さて、パーティーはどうだったね？\r\n君のおかげで皆も喜んでいたな"
